{%- comment -%}
  Lowest current price in a collection. Filled in by the browser (theme.js) from a tiny cached view
  (/collections/handle?sort_by=price-ascending&view=minprice), so pages don't load 50 products per tile.
  Param: collection
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if collection != blank -%}<span class="js-from" data-from-price="{{ collection.handle }}"></span>{%- endif -%}
